# Stage 14 — Sample EPUB (GATE)

Build a sample-chapter EPUB and validate it before the full book.

1. Choose at least one representative chapter (if the book has figures/tables,
   include a chapter that has them).
2. Call `build_sample_epub` with the chosen `chapter_slugs`.
3. Call `epubcheck` on `preproduction/stage2_sample/sample_book.epub`.
4. Write `preproduction/stage2_sample/sample_review.md` with a checklist
   (EPUBCheck result, cover, fonts, figure/table handling, nav labels) and a final
   `sample_review_status: PASS` or `FAIL`.

If anything FAILs, fix the spec/frontmatter/assets and rebuild. Only the
controller records the deterministic PASS decision.

Exit condition: sample EPUB built, EPUBCheck clean, sample_review_status PASS.
